; 故意不写 LIBRARY 语句：写了就会被当成导入库里记的 DLL 名，
; 32 位构建（产物是 TWAIN_APP_CMD32.dll）会被记成 TWAIN_APP_CMD64.dll，
; 运行时照着这个名字去加载，只能失败。省略时链接器用真正的输出文件名，
; 同一份 def 就能同时供 Win32 和 x64 两个配置用。
EXPORTS
    zhx_twain_test
    zhx_twain
    zhx_Init
    zhx_GetDevicesList
    zhx_OpenDevice
    zhx_Scan
    zhx_EndScan
    zhx_CloseDevice
    zhx_Exit
    zhx_GetState
    zhx_GetCurrentDevice
    zhx_ShowSettingUI
    zhx_PumpMessages
    zhx_GetScanDiagnosis
    zhx_GetLastOpenResult
    zhx_SetTransferMechanism
    zhx_SetImageFileFormat
    zhx_GetCurrentFileFormat
    zhx_GetSupportedFileFormats
    zhx_SetResolution
    zhx_GetSupportedResolutions
    zhx_GetCurrentResolution
    zhx_GetDevCapability_JSON
    zhx_GetCapability_STR
    zhx_SetCapability_STR
    zhx_GetDevCapability_STR